otengine/godot/pulls/115340","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-15T12:35:47Z"},{"id":4114029031,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc71Nxnn","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"a82b69a5549b1ac37aaf7b68c4539a335d764036","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code and documentation look good to me.\r\n\r\nThe feature makes sense to be in Control rather than Node, as we want to minimize the number of properties in Node for memory usage reasons (since every node would have the property). We can implement it separately in Label3D later if there's enough demand, but it can be worked around in script for now.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_115340.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26751223/test_pr_115340.zip)\r\n\r\nGenerated POT from the project:\r\n\r\n```pot\r\n# LANGUAGE translation for  for the following files:\r\n# res://control.tscn\r\n#\r\n# FIRST AUTHOR <EMAIL@ADDRESS>, YEAR.\r\n#\r\n#, fuzzy\r\nmsgid \"\"\r\nmsgstr \"\"\r\n\"Project-Id-Version: \\n\"\r\n\"MIME-Version: 1.0\\n\"\r\n\"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\\n\"\r\n\"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8-bit\\n\"\r\n\r\n#: control.tscn\r\nmsgid \"Example\"\r\nmsgstr \"\"\r\n\r\n#: control.tscn\r\nmsgctxt \"custom\"\r\nmsgid \"Example\"\r\nmsgstr \"\"\r\n```","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115340#pullrequestreview-4114029031","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115340","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-15T13:38:0